  "details": "Udon allows SphericalHarmonicsL2 variables, but calling functions on them doesn't seem to modify them.\nIn testing, SphericalHarmonicsL2.AddAmbientLight and SphericalHarmonicsL2.AddDirectionalLight have no effect on variables when called from Udon. When evaluating the probe from Udon, the result is black.\nNo errors are produced in the log. \nSample script (for U#): https://gist.github.com/s-ilent/4a6ffbba19674c9910919340cc1a785d",
